\ Seven reference hidden drops for Foundation Day as calculation and target.
\ The values below are printed in the main branch's canonical README.
\ This checks all seven outputs, not just the first hidden drop.
\ A failure is reported through the same report as the earlier checks.

To check the seven Foundation hidden drops:
  Put "1" into the sauce input's calculation count.
  Put "1" into the sauce input's requested count.
  Put "1" into the sauce input's distance count.
  Put "2" into the sauce input's sum count.
  Put "2" into the sauce input's direction count.
  Make all seven hidden drops.
  If the hidden drops' first drop is not "119390830530032782664128530203002080344",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 1 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' second drop is not "11877236279154673426874867061566696749",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 2 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' third drop is not "24217814924229232987463457533828175476",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 3 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' fourth drop is not "166629231917547214614573522551290204247",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 4 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' fifth drop is not "81202913407267092008896220686064041568",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 5 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' sixth drop is not "73551520026920072430116213847585486272",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 6 check failed." into the check report; exit.
  If the hidden drops' seventh drop is not "6164285870955721082771365327359496898",
    put "The Foundation hidden drop 7 check failed." into the check report; exit.
